Now I have updated the dump patch to also print the latest messages to the
dump file, as David Damerell suggested. They appear after the skills list,
before goodbye message and scoring information.

The updated patch is downloadable at
http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nethack.html#dump
and I also made an incremental diff for those of you who already use the
previous version of the patch (also included at the end of this posting):
http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nh/dumpmsg.diff

To define the number of messages to be dumped, add
#define DUMPMSGS 20
to your include/config.h. I think 20 is a good number, but if you like to
have more, just increase the number in the macro definiton.
And here is the incremental diff:

